$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Macrocyclization upon treatment of 15 with CsF (15 equiv, 0.007 M DMSO,
25°C, 10 h) proceeded in superb conversions (74-80%) to provide a
separable 3:1 mixture of P:M atropisomers favoring the natural
stereochemistry. Under these conditions, N-Teoc deprotection was effected
providing the amine 17 directly and only trace quantities of the
corresponding N-Teoc derivative 16 were isolated (6-13%).19 16:
P-atropisomer: [α]25 D -63 (c 0.03, CH2Cl2); 1H NMR (CD3OD, 315 K, 600
MHz) δ 8.12 (s, 1H), 7.59 (s, 1H), 7.58 (d, 7 = 8.3 Hz, 1H), 7.25-7.20
(m, 6H), 7.13 (d, J = 7.4 Hz, 1H), 7.00-6.98 (m, 4H), 6.93-6.89 (m, 4H),
6.61 (d, 7= 2.2 Hz, 1H), 6.34 (br s, 2H), 6.16 (s, 1H), 5.85 (s, 1H),
5.64 (s, 1H), 5.36 (s, 1H), 5.23 (s, 1H), 5.21 (br s, 1H), 4.77 (d, J =
6.5 Hz, 1H), 4.75 (d, J = 6.5 Hz, 1H), 4.56 (s, 1H), 4.46 (s, 2H), 4.31
(dd, J = 7.0, 4.4 Hz, 1H), 4.13 (s, 3H), 4.09^1.05 (m, 2H), 3.98 (dd, 7=
10.5, 4.0 Hz, 1H), 3.88 (s, 3H), 3.75-3.71 (m, 2H), 3.68 (s, 3H), 3.60
(s, 3H), 3.58-3.55 (m, 5H), 3.47 (br s, 2H), 3.44 (s, 3H), 3.36 (s, 3H),
2.83 (br s, 1H), 1.37 (s, 9H), 0.02 (s, 9H); IR (film) νmax 3370, 2924,
2849, 2501, 1720, 1685, 1656, 1603, 1582, 1535, 1510, 1461, 1438, 1414,
1345, 1308, 1263, 1236, 1196, 1160, 1143, 1056, 1026, 935, 838, 814, 733,
697 cm-1; ESIMS m/z 1728 (M+ + Na, C86H97ClN8O25Si requires 1728)
MALDIFTMS (DHB) mJz 1627.5287 ((M - Boc)+ + Na, C86H97ClN8O25Si requires
1627.5391). M-atropisomer: [α]25 D -30 (c 0.02, CH2Cl2); 1H NMR (CD3OD,
315 K, 600 MHz) δ 8.10 (br s, 1H), 7.61 (s, 1H), 7.60 (br s, 1H), 7.41
(dd, J = 8.3, 2.6 Hz, 1H), 7.25-7.22 (m, 5H), 7.17 (dd, J = 9.2, 2.6 Hz,
1H), 7.13 (d, J = 7.4 Hz, 1H), 7.00-6.98 (m, 1H), 6.94-6.90 (m, 4H), 6.60
(d, J = 2.2 Hz, 1H), 6.36 (s, 1H), 6.33 (s, 1H), 6.20 (s, 1H), 5.72 (s,
1H), 5.61 (s, 1H), 5.55 (s, 1H), 5.27 (s, 1H), 5.25 (br s, 1H), 4.47 (s,
2H), 4.32 (br s, 1H), 4.13 (s, 3H), 4.10-4.05 (m, 2H), 3.66 (s, 3H), 3.58
(s, 3H), 3.59-3.56 (m, 5H), 3.50 (s, 3H), 3.46-3.44 (m, 4H), 3.36 (s,
3H), 2.91 (br s, 1H), 1.38 (s, 9H), 0.01 (s, 9H); IR (film) νmax 3379,
2922, 2851, 1738, 1712, 1682, 1651, 1605, 1584, 1537, 1505, 1455, 1420,
1348, 1260, 1235, 1205, 1143, 1087, 1026, 841, 802, 697 cm-1; ESIMS m/z
1728 (M+ + Na, C86H97ClN8O25Si requires 1727.5915).
